{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Cadence Video Player 是一款原生影片播放器，適用於 Mac、iPhone、iPad 及 Apple TV，可直接指向本機資料夾或 NAS 並即時播放，無需訂閱、廣告或帳戶。它適合把影片收藏整理在 NAS、重視檔案原貌的用戶，打開資料夾就能按播放。原價 US $0.99，現時限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-55.webp\">\n<h2>原生播放器全面支援各格式</h2>\n<p>支援 MKV、MP4、MOV、TS、AVI 及 WebM 等常見格式，涵蓋 H.264、HEVC、AV1 及 VP9 編碼，DTS、TrueHD、FLAC、Opus 等音軌由 App 自行解碼。它會按內建喇叭、耳機、AirPlay 或擴音機分別混音，並設對白音量控制。文字與圖形字幕可直接從檔案讀取，字體、顏色與大小皆可自訂，並自動選用你慣用的語言。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2778x1284bb-9-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-298-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-299-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-300-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2778x1284bb-10-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-301-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Cadence Video Player</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T20:44:22.277468+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":401,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T20:19:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T04:58:42.491166+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T20:38:28.380339+00:00","content_hash":"08a63c636f28f91113b17a750e9f27b0a58a0f97db5b09a16c63aa84c7718683","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}